 "description": "Compare two IAM policies and report what the change grants or removes. The comparison is over action-and-resource pairs rather than over statements, so a refactor that splits one statement into three reports no change. A newly written pair already covered by a broader unconditioned pattern is noted rather than reported, since nothing new is granted. A removed Deny is reported as a widening even when no Allow changed, because a Deny overrides every Allow. Pay 190000 atomic USDC on Base via exact x402. MCP does not pay; it provides a challenge handoff.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "after": {
    "description": "The later policy. An IAM policy document as JSON text. Statement may be a single object or an array. Nothing is fetched: no cloud account is contacted and no credential is accepted, so the document supplied is the whole input.",
    "example": "{\n \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n \"Statement\": [\n  {\n   \"Sid\": \"ReadExports\",\n   \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n   \"Action\": [\n    \"s3:GetObject\"\n   ],\n   \"Resource\": [\n    \"arn:aws:s3:::exports/*\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"Sid\": \"WriteExports\",\n   \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n   \"Action\": [\n    \"s3:PutObject\"\n   ],\n   \"Resource\": [\n    \"arn:aws:s3:::exports/*\"\n   ]\n  }\n ]\n}",
    "maxLength": 262144,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "before": {
    "description": "The earlier policy. An IAM policy document as JSON text. Statement may be a single object or an array. Nothing is fetched: no cloud account is contacted and no credential is accepted, so the document supplied is the whole input.",
    "example": "{\n \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n \"Statement\": [\n  {\n   \"Sid\": \"ReadExports\",\n   \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n   \"Action\": [\n    \"s3:GetObject\"\n   ],\n   \"Resource\": [\n    \"arn:aws:s3:::exports/*\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"Sid\": \"DenyProduction\",\n   \"Effect\": \"Deny\",\n   \"Action\": [\n    \"s3:DeleteObject\"\n   ],\n   \"Resource\": [\n    \"arn:aws:s3:::production/*\"\n   ]\n  }\n ]\n}",
    "maxLength": 262144,
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "before",
   "after"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "iam_policy_diff",
